        "Content": "All 4-bedroom homes are now Sale Agreed.\r\n\r\nA limited number of our final 5-bedroom homes remain available.\r\n\r\nViewing by private appointment - Call DNG New Homes today 01 4912600\r\n\r\nA Rare Collection of Eight Exceptional Homes in the Heart of Enniskerry\r\n\r\nDNG New Homes and Rosemount Properties and Developments Ltd are proud to unveil Merlin's Way, an exquisite and truly rare collection of just eight exceptional detached residences in the heart of Enniskerry, Co. Wicklow. This prestigious development offers a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to own a home of remarkable quality in one of Ireland's most desirable and historic settings.\r\n\r\nFramed by the dramatic beauty of the Wicklow Mountains and only moments from the charm of Enniskerry village, Merlin's Way has been conceived to redefine modern family living while embracing the timeless elegance of its surroundings. Each residence, ranging from 234 sq.m. to 281 sq.m., has been designed with an attention to detail typically reserved for bespoke, one-off commissions. The result is a collection of homes that marry the artistry of handcrafted design with the cohesion of a carefully planned development — an offering as rare as it is refined.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, a sense of grandeur and light prevails. A welcoming hallway flows into generously proportioned living and dining rooms, complemented by a private study and guest shower room. At the heart of every home is a spectacular open-plan kitchen, dining and living space — a showpiece created for both everyday living and memorable entertaining. These kitchens are masterpieces of craft and design, commissioned from Gallagher Kitchens with bespoke cabinetry, featuring elegant Alinda white quartz surfaces, coffee docks, extensive walk-in pantries and statement islands with integrated wine fridges. Premium appliances, including the Elise Luxe 100 Induction Range Cooker with antique brass trim, larder fridge and freezer and classic Belfast sink, set a new standard for luxury living. Every element, from the smoked oak carcasses to the soft LED mood lighting, has been carefully curated to create warmth, sophistication and timeless appeal.\r\n\r\nThe sense of indulgence continues throughout the home. Elegant fitted walk-in wardrobes with handcrafted finishes, beautifully tiled bathrooms with freestanding baths, high-quality sanitary ware and practical yet refined utility and boot rooms ensure that every corner of the home is as functional as it is luxurious. Landscaped gardens with expansive patios extend the living space outdoors, while attic trusses provide the potential for an additional c.504 sq.ft., future-proofing each home for generations to come.\r\n\r\nEnniskerry Village perfectly complements these remarkable residences. With its distinctive Clock Tower and vibrant village square, it offers artisan cafés, boutique shopping, renowned restaurants and access to world-class amenities including the Powerscourt Estate, Golf Club and the award-winning ESPA spa at Powerscourt Hotel. Families will appreciate the wealth of excellent schools nearby, including Powerscourt National School and St. Gerard's, while outdoor enthusiasts will find endless adventure in the surrounding landscapes, from the Wicklow Way to the famous Bray to Greystones Cliff Walk.\r\n\r\nThough nestled in this idyllic countryside setting, Merlin's Way enjoys superb connectivity. The N11 and M50 are within minutes, with feeder buses to Bray DART and direct routes into Dublin, ensuring the tranquillity of village life comes with seamless access to the city.\r\n\r\nMerlin's Way is not simply a development - it is a statement of architectural excellence, a limited collection of homes crafted to the highest standards and a rare opportunity to live at the very pinnacle of modern luxury in the Garden of Ireland. With only eight residences available, this is an exclusive offering from Rosemount Properties and Developments Ltd.\r\n\r\nRegister your interest today at MerlinsWay.ie or contact DNG New Homes on 01 491 2600 to secure your place in this once-in-a-generation community."
